{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09529","headline":"邵陵作 · 张谓","name":"邵陵作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻虞帝苦忧人，祗爲苍生不爲身。\n已道一朝辞北阙，何须五月更南巡。\n昔时文武皆销铄，今日精灵常寂寞。\n斑竹年来笋自生，白苹春尽花空落。\n遥望零陵见旧丘，苍梧云起至今愁。\n惟余帝子千行泪，添作潇湘万里流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}